<div class="mk-crumbbar"><div class="mk-wrap in"><a href="/markets">Markets</a><span class="sep">&rsaquo;</span><span class="here">Optical &amp; Sensors</span></div></div><section class="mk-hero" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="light" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap mk-hero-in"><div><div class="mk-eyebrow">Markets we serve</div><h1 class="mk-h1">Optical and sensor manufacturing</h1><p class="mk-lede">Hana manufactures an array of optical and environmental sensors for various applications through our specialized focus on minature packaging capabilities and patented processes. These products are built under controlled handling and ESD conditions, with optical and sensor manufacturing capability across multiple Hana sites.</p><div class="mk-btns"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-primary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Talk to us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a><a href="#products" class="hana-btn hana-btn-secondary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Product examples</a></div></div><div class="mk-hero-media"><img src="~/images/photos/mk-optical-sensors-hero.webp" alt="Camera module and optical sensor assembly" /></div></div><div class="mk-wrap" style="position:relative;z-index:1;padding-bottom:52px;"><div class="mk-strip"><span class="hana-spec-label" style="flex-shrink:0;">Product examples</span><div class="mk-chips"><span>Camera modules</span><span>Proximity sensors</span><span>Ambient light sensors</span><span>MEMS sensors</span><span>Infrared modules</span><span>Environmental sensors</span></div></div></div></section><section class="mk-dark opd-sec img-ghost" id="opdSec"><img class="opd-bg" src="~/images/photos/mk-optical-sensors-sot-packages.jpeg" alt="Miniature optical sensor packages shown at scale" style="opacity:.416;--gs:3%;--ge:55%;transform:scale(1.15);transform-origin:right center;"/><div class="opd-scrim"></div><div class="mk-wrap in"><div class="opd-tile"><img src="~/images/photos/mk-optical-sensors-packaging-modules.webp" alt="Optical sensor packages"/></div><div style="max-width:760px;margin-bottom:30px;"><div class="mk-eyebrow on-dark">Optical packaging development</div><h2 class="mk-h2 on-dark">Always at the forefront of optical packaging design</h2><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="margin:14px 0 0;">Hana's patended packaging capability has developed across several parallel engineering paths for the past 15 years. From optical-path control and package miniaturization to moisture and temperature performance, we are pushing the boundaries for the future.</p></div><div class="opd"><div class="opd-axis"><div class="yr" style="left:22px">2010</div><div class="yr" style="left:106px">2012</div><div class="yr" style="left:190px">2014</div><div class="yr" style="left:274px">2015</div><div class="yr" style="left:358px">2017</div><div class="yr" style="left:442px">2019</div><div class="yr" style="left:526px">2020</div><div class="yr" style="left:610px">2021</div><div class="yr" style="left:694px">2022</div><div class="yr" style="left:778px">2023</div><svg width="900" height="14" style="position:absolute;left:0;top:20px;overflow:visible"><path d="M0 7 H886" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4"/><path d="M884 2 l6 5 -6 5" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4"/><circle cx="22" cy="7" r="4" fill="#0E4A7C" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4"/><circle cx="106" cy="7" r="4" fill="#0E4A7C" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4"/><circle cx="190" cy="7" r="4" fill="#0E4A7C" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4"/><circle cx="274" cy="7" r="4" fill="#0E4A7C" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4"/><circle cx="358" cy="7" r="4" fill="#0E4A7C" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4"/><circle cx="442" cy="7" r="4" fill="#0E4A7C" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4"/><circle cx="526" cy="7" r="4" fill="#0E4A7C" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4"/><circle cx="610" cy="7" r="4" fill="#0E4A7C" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4"/><circle cx="694" cy="7" r="4" fill="#0E4A7C" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4"/><circle cx="778" cy="7" r="4" fill="#0E4A7C" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4"/></svg></div><div class="opd-grid"><div class="guide" style="left:22px"></div><div class="guide" style="left:106px"></div><div class="guide" style="left:190px"></div><div class="guide" style="left:274px"></div><div class="guide" style="left:358px"></div><div class="guide" style="left:442px"></div><div class="guide" style="left:526px"></div><div class="guide" style="left:610px"></div><div class="guide" style="left:694px"></div><div class="guide" style="left:778px"></div><div class="trk" style="--c:#5CA9E4;height:110px"><div class="side"><div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="8" width="18" height="9" rx="2"/><path d="M6 8V6h12v2"/></svg></div><div><h3>Cap &amp; filter</h3><p>Development of package structures for optical-path control and wavelength filtering.</p></div></div><svg width="900" height="22" style="position:absolute;left:0;top:10px"><path d="M0 13 H900" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,.22)" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M22 13 V22" stroke="var(--c)" stroke-width="1.3"/><circle cx="22" cy="13" r="4" fill="#0E4A7C" stroke="var(--c)" stroke-width="1.4"/><path d="M190 13 V22" stroke="var(--c)" stroke-width="1.3"/><circle cx="190" cy="13" r="4" fill="#0E4A7C" stroke="var(--c)" stroke-width="1.4"/><path d="M442 13 V22" stroke="var(--c)" stroke-width="1.3"/><circle cx="442" cy="13" r="4" fill="#0E4A7C" stroke="var(--c)" stroke-width="1.4"/><path d="M610 13 V22" stroke="var(--c)" stroke-width="1.3"/><circle cx="610" cy="13" r="4" fill="#0E4A7C" stroke="var(--c)" stroke-width="1.4"/></svg><div class="card" style="left:22px;top:29px"><image-slot mini id="opd00" class="slot" placeholder="Photo"></image-slot><span class="cl">Metal cap</span></div><div class="card" style="left:190px;top:29px"><image-slot mini id="opd01" class="slot" placeholder="Photo"></image-slot><span class="cl">Plastic cap</span></div><div class="card" style="left:442px;top:29px"><image-slot mini id="opd02" class="slot" placeholder="Photo"></image-slot><span class="cl">Ink mask</span></div><div class="card" style="left:610px;top:29px"><image-slot mini id="opd03" class="slot" placeholder="Photo"></image-slot><span class="cl">Film-assist molding</span></div></div><div class="trk" style="--c:#7EC8FF;height:110px"><div class="side"><div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 4v6m0 4v6"/><path d="M9 7l3-3 3 3M9 17l3 3 3-3"/><path d="M4 12h16"/></svg></div><div><h3>Package thickness</h3><p>Optical LGA thickness reduced from 0.50 mm to 0.30 mm.</p></div></div><svg width="900" height="22" style="position:absolute;left:0;top:10px"><path d="M0 13 H900" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,.22)" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M358 13 V22" stroke="var(--c)" stroke-width="1.3"/><circle cx="358" cy="13" r="4" fill="#0E4A7C" stroke="var(--c)" stroke-width="1.4"/><path d="M610 13 V22" stroke="var(--c)" stroke-width="1.3"/><circle cx="610" cy="13" r="4" fill="#0E4A7C" stroke="var(--c)" stroke-width="1.4"/><path d="M778 13 V22" stroke="var(--c)" stroke-width="1.3"/><circle cx="778" cy="13" r="4" fill="#0E4A7C" stroke="var(--c)" stroke-width="1.4"/></svg><div class="card" style="left:358px;top:29px"><image-slot mini id="opd10" class="slot" placeholder="Photo"></image-slot><span class="cl">0.50 mm</span></div><div class="card" style="left:610px;top:29px"><image-slot mini id="opd11" class="slot" placeholder="Photo"></image-slot><span class="cl">0.35 mm</span></div><div class="card" style="left:778px;top:29px"><image-slot mini id="opd12" class="slot" placeholder="Photo"></image-slot><span class="cl">0.30 mm</span></div></div><div class="trk" style="--c:#93D3FF;height:110px"><div class="side"><div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 8V5h3M20 8V5h-3M4 16v3h3M20 16v3h-3"/><rect x="8.5" y="9" width="7" height="6" rx="1"/></svg></div><div><h3>Module footprint</h3><p>Progressive footprint reduction through package architecture changes.</p></div></div><svg width="900" height="22" style="position:absolute;left:0;top:10px"><path d="M0 13 H900" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,.22)" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M274 13 V22" stroke="var(--c)" stroke-width="1.3"/><circle cx="274" cy="13" r="4" fill="#0E4A7C" stroke="var(--c)" stroke-width="1.4"/><path d="M526 13 V22" stroke="var(--c)" stroke-width="1.3"/><circle cx="526" cy="13" r="4" fill="#0E4A7C" stroke="var(--c)" stroke-width="1.4"/><path d="M694 13 V22" stroke="var(--c)" stroke-width="1.3"/><circle cx="694" cy="13" r="4" fill="#0E4A7C" stroke="var(--c)" stroke-width="1.4"/></svg><div class="card" style="left:274px;top:29px"><image-slot mini id="opd20" class="slot" placeholder="Photo"></image-slot><span class="cl">1.44 &times; 2.84 mm</span></div><div class="card" style="left:526px;top:29px"><image-slot mini id="opd21" class="slot" placeholder="Photo"></image-slot><span class="cl">1 &times; 2 mm</span></div><div class="card" style="left:694px;top:29px"><image-slot mini id="opd22" class="slot" placeholder="Photo"></image-slot><span class="cl">1 &times; 1.5 mm</span></div></div><div class="trk" style="--c:#A8DCFF;height:110px"><div class="side"><div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3s6 6.5 6 10.5A6 6 0 0 1 6 13.5C6 9.5 12 3 12 3z"/><circle cx="14.5" cy="14" r="1"/></svg></div><div><h3>Moisture sensitivity</h3><p>Material development from MSL3 to MSL1.</p></div></div><svg width="900" height="22" style="position:absolute;left:0;top:10px"><path d="M0 13 H900" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,.22)" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M106 13 V22" stroke="var(--c)" stroke-width="1.3"/><circle cx="106" cy="13" r="4" fill="#0E4A7C" stroke="var(--c)" stroke-width="1.4"/><path d="M526 13 V22" stroke="var(--c)" stroke-width="1.3"/><circle cx="526" cy="13" r="4" fill="#0E4A7C" stroke="var(--c)" stroke-width="1.4"/></svg><div class="card" style="left:106px;top:29px"><image-slot mini id="opd30" class="slot" placeholder="Photo"></image-slot><span class="cl">MSL3</span></div><div class="card" style="left:526px;top:29px"><image-slot mini id="opd31" class="slot" placeholder="Photo"></image-slot><span class="cl">MSL1</span></div></div><div class="trk" style="--c:#BDE5FF;height:110px"><div class="side"><div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14 14.8V5a2 2 0 0 0-4 0v9.8a4 4 0 1 0 4 0z"/><path d="M12 9v6"/></svg></div><div><h3>Working temperature</h3><p>Clear molding materials developed for operation up to 125 &deg;C.</p></div></div><svg width="900" height="22" style="position:absolute;left:0;top:10px"><path d="M0 13 H900" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,.22)" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M106 13 V22" stroke="var(--c)" stroke-width="1.3"/><circle cx="106" cy="13" r="4" fill="#0E4A7C" stroke="var(--c)" stroke-width="1.4"/><path d="M778 13 V22" stroke="var(--c)" stroke-width="1.3"/><circle cx="778" cy="13" r="4" fill="#0E4A7C" stroke="var(--c)" stroke-width="1.4"/></svg><div class="card" style="left:106px;top:29px"><image-slot mini id="opd40" class="slot" placeholder="Photo"></image-slot><span class="cl">85 &deg;C</span></div><div class="card" style="left:778px;top:29px"><image-slot mini id="opd41" class="slot" placeholder="Photo"></image-slot><span class="cl">100 &deg;C / 125 &deg;C</span></div></div></div></div></section><section id="products" data-hana-bg="pcb" data-variant="light" data-fade="none" style="background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--line);position:relative;overflow:hidden;"><div class="mk-wrap" style="position:relative;z-index:1;padding-top:64px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:28px;"><h2 class="mk-h2">Product examples</h2></div><div class="mk-cards c3"><a class="mk-card" href="/markets/optical-sensors/camera-modules"><div class="mk-ph"><img src="~/images/photos/mk-optical-sensors-card-mems-sensors.webp" alt="Camera modules with lens holders over the image sensor" style="position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;" /></div><div class="body"><div class="t">Camera Modules &amp; Sensors</div><p>Complete camera-module assembly, including image sensor integration, active optical alignment, lens housings and infrared module capability, with functional test at finished-unit level.</p><span class="more">Explore <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></div></a><a class="mk-card" href="/markets/optical-sensors/mems-sensors"><div class="mk-ph"><img src="~/images/photos/mk-optical-sensors-card-camera-modules.webp" alt="Optical sensor die mounted on a board under an open holder" style="position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;" /></div><div class="body"><div class="t">MEMS &amp; Optical Sensor Packages</div><p>MEMS, proximity, temperature, Lidar, ambient-light, color and time-of-flight sensor assembly and packaging under cleanroom and ESD-controlled conditions.</p><span class="more">Explore <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></div></a><a class="mk-card" href="/markets/automotive/sensor-assembly"><div class="mk-ph"><img src="~/images/mk-automotive-sensor-assembly-samples.webp" alt="A sample of assembled automotive sensor packages" style="position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;" /></div><div class="body"><div class="t">Automotive Sensor Assembly</div><p>MEMS and optical sensor assembly for ADAS, radar and in-cabin sensing, including stress-managed attachment and controlled-environment packaging.</p><span class="more">Explore <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></div></a></div></div></section><section style="background:var(--hana-blue-tint);border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:56px;"><div style="max-width:720px;margin-bottom:24px;"><div class="mk-eyebrow">Footprint</div><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Where we build</h2><p class="mk-body">Optical and sensor programs are manufactured across Hana sites in the USA and Thailand, with camera modules and microdisplays concentrated in Ohio and sensor assembly in Ayutthaya. Programs can be qualified across additional Hana capability where required for manufacturing continuity. See <a href="/locations">Locations</a> for plant-level detail.</p></div><div class="mk-locs"><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/ohio"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">USA</span></span><div class="nm">Ohio</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/ayutthaya"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">Thailand</span></span><div class="nm">Ayutthaya</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/lamphun"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">Thailand</span></span><div class="nm">Lamphun</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a></div></div></section><section style="background:#fff;"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:22px;"><div class="mk-eyebrow">FAQ</div><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Frequently asked questions</h2><p class="mk-body">Common questions from optical and sensor engineering and procurement teams.</p></div><div style="max-width:860px;"><details class="mk-faq" open><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">What does Hana build for optical and sensor products?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Hana manufactures camera modules, including infrared modules, MEMS and optical sensors such as proximity, ambient light, color and time-of-flight devices. Depending on the program, these can be assembled and tested as complete optical or sensor units.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Why does optical and sensor assembly need cleanroom and alignment?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Optical and sensor products can require micron-level alignment and controlled protection from contamination and static discharge. Hana uses cleanroom manufacturing, controlled ESD handling and active optical alignment for camera modules where required by the product.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Which sites serve optical and sensor programs?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Camera modules and microdisplays are manufactured in Ohio, USA, while proximity, ambient light and MEMS sensor assembly runs in Ayutthaya, Thailand. Supporting board-level assembly is also available in Lamphun.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Can Hana handle miniature, sensitive sensor assemblies?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Yes. Hana supports miniature optical and MEMS sensor assemblies using low-stress die attach, controlled handling and cleanroom manufacturing processes.</p></details></div></div></section><section class="mk-cta" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="dark" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap in"><div><h2 class="mk-h2 on-dark" style="max-width:520px;">Start an optical or sensor build program with Hana</h2><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="font-size:16px;max-width:480px;">Tell us what the device has to see or sense, and where it runs. We will point you to the right site and processes, and come back with a plan.</p></div><div class="acts"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-on-dark" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Contact us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a></div></div></section>
